{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15222110","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15222110","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1522211001:0":{"text":"あの……皆さんは、副官の部下なんですか？","source_cn":"几位大人，你们是副将大人的手下吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x91FF3AFD2B006B90","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:2:1522211001":{"text":"あの……皆さんは、副官の部下なんですか？","source_cn":"几位大人，你们是副将大人的手下吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x91FF3AFD2B006B90","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1522211002:0":{"text":"えっ……？","source_cn":"什……什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F9043C8DE6D9833","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1522211003:0":{"text":"では、私からご紹介を……我々は魔法協会の者でして、今回は領主様にお会いするためにやってきました。","source_cn":"请容许我做自我介绍：我们三人是魔法师协会的成员，此次来...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC82CA2A48DC8021","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1522211004:0":{"text":"メイジ？領主様に会えるなんて、すごい人たちに違いない……！","source_cn":"魔法师？还能面见领主？那你们一定都是了不起的大人物……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4E3FF738796C48BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1522211005:0":{"text":"とにかく……ゲホゲホッ！\nとにかく、副官様に感謝の気持ちを伝えてもらえないか？","source_cn":"总之……咳咳！\\n总之能不能拜托你们，把我的谢意转达给...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9F243DC0617F05F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1522211005":{"text":"とにかく……ゲホゲホッ！\nとにかく、副官様に感謝の気持ちを伝えてもらえないか？","source_cn":"总之……咳咳！\\n总之能不能拜托你们，把我的谢意转达给副将大人？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9F243DC0617F05F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1522211006:0":{"text":"あいつ、俺を捕まえようとしたんだぞ！？ニーム、騙されんなって！","source_cn":"谢他？那个副将差点要把我抓走！尼姆，你别被他骗了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5233AD9CADD27FA9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1522211007:1":{"text":"うっ……ゲホゲホッ！シーモン、そんな言い方するなよ……副官は悪党に利用されてるだけで……","source_cn":"咳咳咳……西蒙，别这样说。副将大人只是被蒙蔽了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x642909D984E07521","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1522211008:0":{"text":"あのイアソンたち……<style=\"highlight\">配給のたびに横取りしに来るの、知ってるだろ</style>。","source_cn":"你又不是不认识伊阿宋那群人……<style=highl...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4177F8DEB3A4EAEC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1522211009:0":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">司令官が兵を巡回させてくれてなきゃ</style>、今頃、僕たちは横取りされて餓死してたよ……","source_cn":"如果不是<style=highlight>统帅大人常常...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7CA5DD12D0F3E023","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1522211010:0":{"text":"失礼ですが……今日配給していた兵士も、ペルセウスの親衛兵なのですか？","source_cn":"恕我冒昧，今日发放粮食的士兵也是珀尔修斯派来的亲卫兵吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7EC900860CD1FFB4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1522211011:1":{"text":"先ほどの対応の仕方では、民の信頼は得られぬかと……","source_cn":"适才发生争执时，他们的作为并不能服众。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B57802D6675008C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1522211012:0":{"text":"最近司令官はずっと前線にいて、城内のことまで手が回らないみたいでさ。","source_cn":"统帅大人最近好像一直在前线，不怎么插手城内的事。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD9FA972BA8242807","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1522211013:0":{"text":"じゃなかったら、俺だってあんなやつと口論する気にもならないって……","source_cn":"要不是这样，我也不想浪费力气和那个无耻的家伙吵架……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3DD34003A7275B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}